# Do not put SwingPilot credentials in project .env files or OneDrive.
# Run npm run local:setup in a local interactive terminal instead.
# Configuration is written outside the project to:
# Windows: %LOCALAPPDATA%/SwingPilot/config/settings.json
# Test setup uses %LOCALAPPDATA%/SwingPilot-test/config/settings.json
# No OpenAI or IBKR API key is required.
